Subject: [PATCH] hakuX #112 item 2 / #41: Fog radial priming suite

FogGenTests' scene drawn fixed-function in a rotated quad order, each
followed by the same scene under a vertex program with RADIAL exp fog
(bias 1.5, multiplier -0.000875). Variants A0-A4 per hakuX's
docs/testing/predictions/2026-09-19-fog-radial-carryover-priming.md:
rotations 0/188/21, the label moved to y=400 for A3, and an intervening
programmable draw for A4.
